.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt PAM-CIBA.YAML 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm app.config.yaml
.Nd configuration of pam-ciba
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Pa /etc/pam-ciba/app.config.yaml
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The file is YAML. Every key takes its default when absent.
.Sh PROVIDER
.Bl -tag -width "request_timeout_seconds"
.It Cm issuer
The OpenID Provider's issuer identifier, an https URL. Its metadata is read
from
.Pa <issuer>/.well-known/openid-configuration .
.It Cm client_id
The public client registered at the provider with the CIBA grant type and
poll delivery.
.It Cm scope
Space-separated scope of the authentication request. It contains
.Li openid .
Default
.Li openid profile .
.It Cm request_timeout_seconds
Bound on each HTTP request to the provider. Default 10.
.El
.Sh APPROVAL
.Bl -tag -width "requested_expiry_seconds"
.It Cm binding_message
Shown to the end-user beside the approval, at most 255 characters.
.Li {user} ,
.Li {host} ,
.Li {rhost}
and
.Li {service}
are replaced with the local account, this host's name, the remote host and
the PAM service. It is sent only while
.Cm authorization_details_type
is empty.
.It Cm requested_expiry_seconds
The request lifetime asked of the provider. 0 takes the provider's default.
.It Cm authorization_details_type
The RFC 9396 authorization details type the provider has registered for
this client. When set, the request carries one authorization detail of that
type with the fields
.Li user ,
.Li host
(the full host name),
.Li remote_host ,
.Li remote_user ,
.Li tty
(left out when it is ssh),
.Li service
and
.Li at ,
a field with no value left out.
Empty sends none.
.El
.Sh USERS
A map of local account name to the provider account it signs in as, sent
as the request's
.Li login_hint .
An account without an entry is refused.
.Sh LOGGING
.Bl -tag -width "max_backups"
.It Cm level
One of error, warn, info, debug. Default info.
.It Cm console
Also log to standard error. Default false.
.It Cm file
The log file. Empty selects
.Pa logs/pam-ciba.log
beside the configuration file.
.It Cm max_size_mb
Log file size before rotation. Default 20.
.It Cm max_backups
Rotated files kept. Default 5.
.It Cm compression
Compress rotated files. Default true.
.It Cm categories
Per-category levels overriding
.Cm level ;
categories are app and auth.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal
schemaVersion: 1
provider:
  issuer: https://auth.example.org
  client_id: host-ssh
users:
  alice: alice@example.org
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pam-ciba 8
